trial_ended.text:
Hello,

The free trial for {store} ended on {date}. The store is now read-only: everything can be read and exported, nothing new is recorded. Activate the subscription under Settings and the store works again at once:
{link}

grace_week.text:
Hello,

The last payment for {store} failed. If it is not settled by {date} the store becomes read-only. Update the payment method under Settings:
{link}
